# cancel-parity has no settings of its own yet. Its tests run against mock flows
# in this repo and need no keys or accounts.
#
# When you run it against your own app, your sign-up and cancel functions read
# their test-account details from here (or from the real environment, which
# wins over this file). Copy this file to .env and add the names they use, for
# example:
#
# CANCEL_PARITY_BASE_URL=     # your staging app's URL
# CANCEL_PARITY_TEST_EMAIL=   # a test account your staging app accepts
